Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,New worlds are being born on a daily basis,\Nlike bubbles rising to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has been corroborated by the observation of a growing number of worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The existence of the "observer" at the root of them all\Nhas long since been predicted by scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This observer has at last been discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of our drifting has been brought about by this boy, named Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's the guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Owing to his actions,\Nour futures have been stolen from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and we have been subjected to the absurdity of different worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Where is this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Burn him at the stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has manifested a great tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:36.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara is guilty of a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, in accordance with our rules,\Nwe shall condemn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The coming tragedy must be prevented.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what manner of judgment they pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will dispatch Koumori the Convictor, of the Beatnik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We know that he will exact a just sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:01.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you go on ahead without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Did you forget something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:08.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, there's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we gonna do? Stick with Hoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have nowhere to go. We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to decide for ourselves what to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:36.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, so you can travel to other worlds in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't bother asking to come with us,\Nbecause you're not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While I'm thinking of it,\Nthere are other castaways who travel between worlds, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Like you guys, they use power relics\Nor take advantage of the properties of a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:02:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Sounds easier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.37,0:02:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might sound easy now,\N but the ability to travel to other worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,took many thousands of years to develop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ew, I can't believe it took thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Immortality sure sounds boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of people are the other castaways?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if they were all like Ms. Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.76,0:02:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really wish that phony teacher would give up the act already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She really had us going.\NWho'd have thought she's our age in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She must have gone to our school once, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true, there are all sorts of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you all possess something immensely powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That ship should keep you all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatcha reading there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this? "Robinson Crusoe"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you have the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:56.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should stop reading that and go help Rajdhani.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you up to over here—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the shortest route to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Observing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite entertaining how they're always going between the same places.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if it's up or down—\Nthey do as they please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the end, what do you think they always do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They start eating each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until there's only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watching them makes me wonder...\Nmight we also end up—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setting them free!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't! I'm still watching them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, something crazy's happening on your screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's leave him to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This drifting was caused by your power, Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you don't need to feel responsible for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God gave you this power knowing full well what it would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:19.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were being used before you even knew what was happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.{This episode brought to you by: this phrase. - Lann}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's an exercise bar doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:54.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wake up. Wake up, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gotta wake up. Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.77,0:05:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?\NOw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked you what your number is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, 3-B, 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Group 3-B!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fall in, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've noted significant issues with Number 25's productivity!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your group will answer for this by having another 50 kilos
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,added to today's quota of 800!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any problems, take them up with Number 25!\NDismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You take the blocks you get from the top and carry them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:56.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about time I head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.83,0:06:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?\NThey finally found the guy\Nresponsible for setting us adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say his name is Nagara,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the Beatnik have determined it's because of him that the drifting is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our lives would have been so much better if it weren't for that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.93,0:06:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:27.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Futatsuboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Naga... ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:35.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagata, that was a close one today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, sorry. Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, I wasn't looking for gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just reminded me of when I was a new guy,\Nand before I knew it I was waking you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...\Nnothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you guys students from Shiraito Middle School No. 2 too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bet you're a novice castaway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:06:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Novice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:04.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're all students from Shiraito Middle School No. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been an awful long time since we were middle-schoolers, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're all building that tower together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:13.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:14.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're trying to get to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heaven is the way out, back to our own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way out? To the outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. But it's more than just that.\NWe're hunting for treasure while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Heaven is the way out,\Nbut there's also treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is the objective here, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:37.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, both of them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is our three-star hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NNothing. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your power won't work here.{I feel like there's potential for a meme here but perhaps it is too forced. We already used it in ep 1 in any case. I'm just noting it to make it known that I have spotted this opportunity to insert a meme and that I am too hesitant to do anything about it -Moe}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because that's the way I decided it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've been wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are we carrying the blocks down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're building a tower, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:32.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'd make more sense if we were carrying them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's just the way it is, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're building the foundations or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Or something"? You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then when will the tower be finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:48.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you go, talking funny again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been 200 years since I got here,\Nand I've never even considered that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You've been at this for 200 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:58.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be surprised at just 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's veterans who've been at it for over a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.77,0:09:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Susugashira.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a bigshot host, who's also part of the Beatnik.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Host? Beatnik?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A host is sort of like the boss of their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:25.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the Beatnik are whatcha might call a dream team,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,made up of all the elites from different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They travel to different worlds and take an active part in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:33.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These elites are currently investigating the cause of the drifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.75,0:09:39.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:44.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one of these fall down before.\NOther than one of mine, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:45.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congrats on your starting pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:57.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting pay? This?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Nagata, it's my treat tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go all out! Nothing more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope they pulverize this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate this guy more than anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setting us all adrift like this...\NHow could he do such a terrible thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Futatsuboshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would you do if I was this Nagara guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're anybody that awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, Nagata, you and me are kindred spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you new here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:39.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's under me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, new guy, have you ever heard the legend of the shooting star?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Word is that somewhere in this tower,\Nthere's a room that shooting stars fall into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:10:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that romantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:01.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:04.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I catch a shooting star, I'm going to make a wish
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I'll meet a handsome husband in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aww, I'm sure you'll meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara has settled in nicely to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't seem to have found the truth behind Babel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can'tcha sleep, Nagata?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.99,0:11:34.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:38.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you wanna go searching for shooting stars with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted. Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're exhausted? After just that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we're chasing some\Nurban legend that might not even be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:02.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay if we don't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The important thing is that we went looking, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:10.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll betcha Hime is gonna be tickled to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you dragged me all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How deeply you believe in nonsense is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:23.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because if we don't,\Nwe won't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:30.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going back.\NWe have an early start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same as building the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't any castaways who really believe\Nthat we'll reach Heaven someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatcha looking at me like that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why are we all doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just a simple worker ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happier giving in to hope like this, even if it's false.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:04.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's okay. Here, you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want it, I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found it! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, no it isn't. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:41.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Shooting stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-They're really here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.57,0:13:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are bugs that emit light in the darkness of the caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you think they do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:02.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They lure other bugs in with these pretty lights,\Nthen hook them with their suspended slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, get out of there!\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagara!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How far did he go to set those ants free?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, there! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rajdhani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This ant is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm telling you, Nagara is somewhere close by!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey new guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All by yourself today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?! It tastes awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:28.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you so displeased with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a wondrous sight, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Babel, rising ever upward into Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A vacuous emptiness, built by human hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then I learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you find Nagara?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently Mizuho and Yamabiko went to pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't need to help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:16:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be of any use there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:06.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara has the power to change worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, he's fine on his own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:11.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that something God told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't hear that voice anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should have done this way sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I could have heard you a lot more clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a bit late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At last, the time for us to depart has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This will be a journey to find our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fear not—we have our freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, we have our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:16:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't the others worried about Nagara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See that boy? He couldn't even do a back hip circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But after lots of practice,\Nhe's gotten so good he can do {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone calls that boy Koumori the Bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no point in being able to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:39.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turning this world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to keep moving forward to make up for everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give Futatsuboshi my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagara. You're at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:19.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koumori the Bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This world is a great big pit, turned upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To keep everyone safe, I lock hope up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:38.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Using my Upside-Down power, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:46.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I've decided I won't run away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I don't want our going adrift to be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NWhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you're all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you let Nagara off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must not descend into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, Nagara is a castaway, just like ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you pass judgment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will this put a stop to all the tragedies?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There won't be any more needless tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:24.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will that be enough to convince the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without an observer,\Neveryone would have ended up as mere probabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that no matter where we wind up,\Nwe have to keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one can accuse Nagara of anything—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor will I allow them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The others have already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:49.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they aren't coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they don't plan to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you also believe that we're never going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:09.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has the light gone out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've decided to go on a voyage in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:28.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I've seen all the other worlds,\NI'm going to crack the truth about this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how far I'm going to get,\Nbut I'm going to do as much as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rajdhani, there's nothing you can't do,\Nand no place you can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, so uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know that statue of Buddha you treasured so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen broke it, and I secretly replaced it with a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:55.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wanted to at least apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just once?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Nagara...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I wanted to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:11.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Monkey Hairball, the power relic you got for beating that world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've spent a long time trying to understand its effects,\Nand I finally figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it a sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:23.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smells good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it smells like sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:28.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that scent will never go away,\Nand it will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you set it on fire, or boil it in curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.91,0:21:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter where it is,\Nor what condition it's in, it never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect power for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:46.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we became friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.11,0:22:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right back at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.71,0:22:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long are you guys planning to stay on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.69,0:22:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi, you can't do anything,\Nso you'd be safer with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara, you'd come too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.29,0:22:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.07,0:22:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.36,0:22:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.74,0:22:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can never go home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.41,0:22:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I'm going to continue down my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like that. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey Nozomi, you're in too, right?
